      <sect2 role="installation">
        <title>Installation of Cosmic-app-library</title>

    <para>Prepare Cosmic-app-library for compilation:</para>

      <para>Now Configure the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="configure">cargo fetch --locked</userinput></screen>

      <para>To Compile the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="make">export LOCKSTEP_XML_PATH="${PWD}/vendor/atspi-common/xml"
cargo build --release --offline
</userinput></screen>

      <para>Now Install the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="install">install -vDm755 target/release/cosmic-app-library /usr/bin/cosmic-app-library

install -vDm644 data/com.system76.CosmicAppLibrary.desktop \
  /usr/share/applications/com.system76.CosmicAppLibrary.desktop

install -vDm644 data/com.system76.CosmicAppLibrary.metainfo.xml \
  /usr/share/metainfo/

cp -v data/icons/com.system76.CosmicAppLibrary.svg /usr/share/icons/hicolor/scalable/apps/
</userinput></screen>

      </sect2>

